  "term": "longevity",
  "definition": "In this psychology context, longevity refers to living into older age, and healthy longevity means not just surviving or avoiding disease but continuing to have a life that feels meaningful, connected, self-directed and socially recognized. It links long life with the quality and significance of a person’s later-life experience.",
